/T (Can I Hinder? is a crowd-interactive 2.5D top-down action-adventure game developed in C++ using SFML 3.0, supported by a backend API and a Progressive Web App \(PWA\) that enables real-time audience participation.)
/E (Can I Hinder? is a crowd-interactive 2.5D top-down action-adventure game developed in C++ using SFML 3.0, supported by a backend API and a Progressive Web App \(PWA\) that enables real-time audience participation.)
