/T (What makes Can I hinder stand out from a traditional action adventure game is the integration of a live spectator interaction layer. External participants can connect to the game via a PWA interface allowing them to influence the game in real time. Spectators are presented with choices that enable them to either assist the player \(buffs\) or hinder the player\(spawning enemies, de-buffs, spawning obstacles\))
/E (What makes Can I hinder stand out from a traditional action adventure game is the integration of a live spectator interaction layer. External participants can connect to the game via a PWA interface allowing them to influence the game in real time. Spectators are presented with choices that enable them to either assist the player \(buffs\) or hinder the player\(spawning enemies, de-buffs, spawning obstacles\))
/Pg 10 0 R
