/Title (In the core gameplay experience, a single player navigates through a series of interconnected maps, engaging in combat with enemies, collecting items that culminate in a climatic boss battle. The game follows a structured progression system, combining exploration, combat and resource management to maintain player interest.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 890 0 R
/Prev 1023 0 R
/Next 1159 0 R
>>
endobj
1159 0 obj
<<
/Title (What makes Can I hinder stand out from a traditional action adventure game is the integration of a live spectator interaction layer. External participants can connect to the game via a PWA interface allowing them to influence the game in real time. Spectators are presented with choices that enable them to either assist the player \(buffs\) or hinder the player\(spawning enemies, de-buffs, spawning obstacles\))
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 890 0 R
/Prev 1158 0 R
/Next 1024 0 R
>>
endobj
